方展示。\r\n\r\n刚刚已上架到 chrome 应用商店，搜索 “V2EX 评论上下文” 即可。\r\n插件免费开源 [https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context]( https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context)\r\n\r\n解决了我自己遇到的一个痛点。如果对你也有用，就更好了。", "content_rendered": "<p><img alt=\"v2ex 评论区楼层引用信息自动展示插件\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://www.mdview.cn/static/other/screenshot_marked.png\"/></p>\n<p>作用是，根据评论中的 #17 ，或者 @<a href=\"/member/xxx\">xxx</a> ，或者“十七楼”，这样的信息，找到最近的一条回复，自动在当前这条评论上方展示。</p>\n<p>刚刚已上架到 chrome 应用商店，搜索 “V2EX 评论上下文” 即可。\n插件免费开源 <a href=\"https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context</a></p>\n<p>解决了我自己遇到的一个痛点。如果对你也有用，就更好了。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1792893543, "replies": 21, "id": 1251601}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 5038, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3418, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 66852, "username": "break", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/break", "website": "http://www.shizuwu.cn", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_mini.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_normal.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_large.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_xlarge.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_xxlarge.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_xxxlarge.png?m=1789095648", "created": 1404351648, "last_modified": 1789095648, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "haorrs", "last_touched": 1792931152, "title": "codex 最新的功能，居然和我之前做的小功能如此雷同", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251621", "created": 1792902207, "deleted": 0, "content": "https://i.imgur.com/UZZm3dU.png\r\n\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/x5tsYce.png\r\n\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/B4nccST.png", "content_rendered": "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/UZZm3dU.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UZZm3dU.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5tsYce.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5tsYce.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/B4nccST.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B4nccST.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>", "last_modified": 1792909230, "replies": 19, "id": 1251621}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_large.png?m=1660301119", "name": "create", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_normal.png?m=1660301119", "title": "分享创造", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/create", "topics": 38157, "footer": "", "header": "欢迎你在这里发布自己的最新作品！", "title_alternative": "Create", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119", "stars": 6246, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 17, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 28162, "username": "dvbs2000", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/dvbs2000", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/89fb/52e6/28162_mini.png?m=1792888715", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/89fb/52e6/28162_normal.png?m=1792888715", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/89fb/52e6/28162_large.png?m=1792888715", "created": 1350261667, "last_modified": 1792888715, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "dvbs2000", "last_touched": 1792923157, "title": "用 ai 实现书法作品自动生成", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251592", "created": 1792888908, "deleted": 0, "content": "昨天忽然想试试看让 ai 学习字帖的文字结构\r\n用一个真实字贴，学习后，生成任何文字的书法作品\r\n\r\n\r\n使用了三层动态书法异形引擎（同字异形 PUA 轮换 + 部件级错落微变 + 弹性笔势场与蘸墨呼吸）与随字赋形不等距纵向排版（ True Bounding-Box Vertical Kerning ），彻底消除电脑排字机械感。\r\n\r\n结果比我预想的好很多\r\n大概能到原字帖 90%水平\r\n\r\nhttps://dvbs2000.github.io/liuchunlin-shufa/\r\n\r\n直接就可以体验，输入任何诗词文字，直接出书法作品下载\r\n\r\n这是 github 地址\r\nhttps://github.com/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa\r\n\r\n\r\n### 3. 兰亭集序（简体）\r\n![lanting_simp.jpg]( https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/lanting_simp.jpg)\r\n\r\n### 4. 山居秋暝（繁体）\r\n![shanju_trad.jpg]( https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/shanju_trad.jpg)\r\n\r\n### 5. 心经（繁体）\r\n![xinjing_trad.jpg]( https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/xinjing_trad.jpg)\r\n\r\n### 6. 长恨歌展示\r\n![showcase_changhenge.jpg]( https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_changhenge.jpg)\r\n\r\n### 7. 春江花月夜 盲测对比\r\n![showcase_chunjiang_blindtest.jpg]( https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_chunjiang_blindtest.jpg)\r\n\r\n### 8. 字帖模拟效果\r\n![showcase_copybook_sim.jpg]( https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_copybook_sim.jpg)\r\n\r\n### 9. 二维码印章演示\r\n![showcase_qr_seal_demo.jpg]( https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_qr_seal_demo.jpg)", "content_rendered": "<p>昨天忽然想试试看让 ai 学习字帖的文字结构\n用一个真实字贴，学习后，生成任何文字的书法作品</p>\n<p>使用了三层动态书法异形引擎（同字异形 PUA 轮换 + 部件级错落微变 + 弹性笔势场与蘸墨呼吸）与随字赋形不等距纵向排版（ True Bounding-Box Vertical Kerning ），彻底消除电脑排字机械感。</p>\n<p>结果比我预想的好很多\n大概能到原字帖 90%水平</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dvbs2000.github.io/liuchunlin-shufa/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://dvbs2000.github.io/liuchunlin-shufa/</a></p>\n<p>直接就可以体验，输入任何诗词文字，直接出书法作品下载</p>\n<p>这是 github 地址\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa</a></p>\n<h3>3. 兰亭集序（简体）</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"lanting_simp.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/lanting_simp.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>4. 山居秋暝（繁体）</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"shanju_trad.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/shanju_trad.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>5. 心经（繁体）</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"xinjing_trad.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/xinjing_trad.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>6. 长恨歌展示</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"showcase_changhenge.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_changhenge.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>7. 春江花月夜 盲测对比</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"showcase_chunjiang_blindtest.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_chunjiang_blindtest.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>8. 字帖模拟效果</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"showcase_copybook_sim.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_copybook_sim.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>9. 二维码印章演示</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"showcase_qr_seal_demo.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_qr_seal_demo.jpg\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1792888908, "replies": 18, "id": 1251592}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 5038, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3418, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 718965, "username": "garydab", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/garydab", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/521af8796ef869b9d7d793733957d035?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/521af8796ef869b9d7d793733957d035?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/521af8796ef869b9d7d793733957d035?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1730966555, "last_modified": 1730966555, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "cctv180", "last_touched": 1792943625, "title": "微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251624", "created": 1792904114, "deleted": 0, "content": "微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的，理论上 codex 是通过图形界面操作微信的，模仿人类的吧. 现在只要我让 codex 操作微信，微信就自动退出，让我重新登录。", "content_rendered": "<p>微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的，理论上 codex 是通过图形界面操作微信的，模仿人类的吧. 现在只要我让 codex 操作微信，微信就自动退出，让我重新登录。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1792904114, "replies": 16, "id": 1251624}]